### 8. Task Search (`taskSearch`)

**Purpose**: Client-side task search with debouncing and HTMX integration.

**Usage**:
```html
<div x-data="taskSearch">
  <input type="text"
         x-model="query"
         @input="search"
         placeholder="Search tasks..." />
  <button @click="clear" x-show="query.length > 0">Clear</button>
  <span x-show="searching" class="loading loading-spinner"></span>
</div>
```

**Properties**:
- `query` (string): Search query
- `searching` (boolean): Search in progress
- `debounceTimer` (number): Debounce timer ID
- `search()`: Trigger search with 300ms debounce
- `clear()`: Clear search and reload all tasks

**Integration**: Used in `views/pages/tasks/list.ejs`

