## Global Events

### show-flash
Trigger toast notifications from anywhere:

```javascript
window.dispatchEvent(new CustomEvent('show-flash', {
  detail: {
    type: 'success',  // success | error | warning | info
    text: 'Operation completed!'
  }
}));
```

---

## HTMX Integration

### HX-Trigger Header
Controllers can trigger toasts via response headers:

```typescript
// In controller
res.setHeader('HX-Trigger', JSON.stringify({
  showSuccess: 'Task created successfully!'
}));
```

Toast manager automatically listens for:
- `showSuccess`: Display success toast
- `showError`: Display error toast

