## Best Practices

### 1. Progressive Enhancement
Always provide fallback behavior without JavaScript:

```html
<!-- Works without JS (form POST) -->
<form method="POST" action="/tasks" hx-post="/tasks">
  <!-- ... -->
</form>
```

### 2. x-cloak
Hide elements until Alpine initializes:

```html
<div x-show="open" x-cloak>
  <!-- Hidden until Alpine loads -->
</div>
```

**CSS** (in `public/css/tailwind.css`):
```css
[x-cloak] { display: none !important; }
```

### 3. Keyboard Navigation
Always support keyboard shortcuts:

```html
<div @keydown.escape="close"
     @keydown.enter="save">
  <!-- ... -->
</div>
```

### 4. Loading States
Show feedback during async operations:

```html
<button @click="save" :disabled="saving">
  <span x-show="!saving">Save</span>
  <span x-show="saving" class="loading loading-spinner"></span>
</button>
```

### 5. Error Handling
Display errors gracefully:

```javascript
try {
  await saveData();
  this.error = null;
} catch (error) {
  this.error = error.message;
  window.dispatchEvent(new CustomEvent('show-flash', {
    detail: { type: 'error', text: 'Save failed' }
  }));
}
```

