## Testing Components

### Manual Testing Checklist
- [ ] Component initializes correctly
- [ ] Keyboard navigation works (Enter, Escape, Tab)
- [ ] Click-outside detection works (dropdowns, modals)
- [ ] localStorage persistence (theme)
- [ ] Focus trapping (modals)
- [ ] Error states display correctly
- [ ] Loading indicators appear during async ops
- [ ] Toast notifications auto-dismiss
- [ ] Responsive behavior on mobile

### Example E2E Test (Playwright)
```typescript
test('inline edit saves task title', async ({ page }) => {
  await page.goto('/tasks/123');

  // Hover to reveal edit button
  await page.hover('h1');

  // Click edit button
  await page.click('[title="Modifier le titre"]');

  // Edit title
  await page.fill('input[x-model="value"]', 'New Title');

  // Press Enter to save
  await page.keyboard.press('Enter');

  // Verify toast notification
  await expect(page.locator('.toast')).toContainText('Modifications enregistrées');
});
```

