## Debugging Tips

### 1. Alpine DevTools
Install Chrome extension: [Alpine.js devtools](https://github.com/alpine-collective/alpine-devtools)

### 2. Console Logging
Add temporary logging in components:

```javascript
Alpine.data('myComponent', () => ({
  init() {
    console.log('Component initialized', this);
  }
}));
```

### 3. x-effect
Debug reactive changes:

```html
<div x-data="{ count: 0 }"
     x-effect="console.log('count changed:', count)">
  <button @click="count++">Increment</button>
</div>
```

### 4. HTMX Logging
Enable in console:

```javascript
htmx.logAll();
```

