## Performance Considerations

### 1. Debouncing
Used in `taskSearch` to avoid excessive requests:

```javascript
this.debounceTimer = setTimeout(() => {
  // Trigger search after 300ms pause
}, 300);
```

### 2. Transition Performance
Use CSS transforms (not properties that trigger layout):

```html
<div x-transition:enter="translate-x-8 opacity-0"
     x-transition:enter-end="translate-x-0 opacity-100">
```

### 3. Lazy Loading
Defer Alpine.js to improve page load:

```html
<script defer src="https://cdn.jsdelivr.net/npm/alpinejs@3.x.x/dist/cdn.min.js"></script>
```

