## Migration Guide

### From jQuery to Alpine.js
```html
<!-- jQuery -->
<div id="myDiv">
  <button onclick="$('#myDiv').toggleClass('active')">Toggle</button>
</div>

<!-- Alpine.js -->
<div x-data="{ active: false }">
  <button @click="active = !active" :class="{ 'active': active }">Toggle</button>
</div>
```

### From React to Alpine.js
```javascript
// React
const [count, setCount] = useState(0);

// Alpine.js
<div x-data="{ count: 0 }">
  <button @click="count++">Increment</button>
  <span x-text="count"></span>
</div>
```

